/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4) RAMP SAFETY NET — common meta/muted text nodes that carried one-off
   grays via inherited/utility paths settle on --ink-3 (muted) so nothing
   reads brighter or dimmer than its tier. Scoped to text-only roles.
   --------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
html body .grid-card .seller,
