   so they breathe at 2K — consistent with the market grid.

   Targeted PER ROUTE via the modal's aria-labelledby slug (content-stable,
   survives row-count changes via ^= prefix). Placed last + matched to the
   specificity of the WAVE-175 27431 catch-all so it wins cleanly.

   FORM / reading-width routes are intentionally LEFT OUT and keep their
   comfortable centered width (a wide 1800px form reads worse):
     - /wallet   -> .wallet-modal, 520px centered overlay (not full-page)
     - /settings -> single-column toggle/field rows, ~940 centered
     - /cart     -> 2-col checkout (.cart-grid) already capped ~1040
   Reuses var(--page-maxw) so it tracks the one page-gutter knob.
   ===================================================================== */
html body .site-root.full-page-mode .modal-backdrop > .info-modal[aria-labelledby^="info-modal-h-database"],
html body .site-root.full-page-mode .modal-backdrop > .info-modal[aria-labelledby^="info-modal-h-loadout-lab"],
html body .site-root.full-page-mode .modal-backdrop > .info-modal[aria-labelledby^="info-modal-h-watchlist"],
html body .site-root.full-page-mode .modal-backdrop > .info-modal[aria-labelledby^="info-modal-h-profile"],
html body .site-root.full-page-mode .modal-backdrop > .info-modal[aria-labelledby^="info-modal-h-support"],
html body .site-root.full-page-mode .modal-backdrop > .info-modal[aria-labelledby^="info-modal-h-incoming"],
html body .site-root.full-page-mode .modal-backdrop > .info-modal[aria-labelledby^="info-modal-h-outgoing"],
