/* WAVE 178b — when a widened info-modal route (watchlist/profile-listings)
   contains a .listing-grid, keep it on a sane auto-fill track sizing so the
   cards fill the now-wider container. The market grid lives in main.layout
   (NOT an info-modal) and keeps its own dense column rules — this is scoped
