/* FIXER B2-1 — .info-modal-body sets text-align:center !important (~21607)
   for prose-style info modals, but the buy-order create form INHERITS it:
   catalogue-picker rows rendered the item name centered ~600px away from its
   thumbnail, and the picked-item summary + field labels floated centered.
   Re-anchor the whole create form left like every other list/form row —
   inheritance carries it to picker rows, picked row, labels and hints.
   Explicitly-centered children (.empty-inline etc.) keep their own rules. */
html body .info-modal .info-modal-body .buyorder-form { text-align: left !important; }

/* FIXER B2-2 — on the full-page /buy-orders route the create form inherited
   the 1800px wide-route panel width, blowing the single-value price/qty
   inputs up to ~1697px wide. Cap the form to the unified narrow form measure
   (wallet 520 / settings 940 family) and center it inside the wide panel.
   Overlay-modal renders (no .full-page-mode ancestor) are already narrow and
   unaffected — max-width only ever shrinks. */
html body .full-page-mode .info-modal .buyorder-form { width: 100% !important; max-width: 620px !important; margin-left: auto !important; margin-right: auto !important; }

/* WAVE 180 — operator-reported (2K @125% scaling -> ~2048px CSS viewport): grid-card internals clipped at any column < ~222px. Root cause: .grid-thumb aspect-ratio:1.1 + min-height:200px derives width from HEIGHT (220px) regardless of card width; card overflow:hidden then clips badges/meta. Constrain thumb to the card and raise the market grid floor so columns never shrink below content. */
