/* ==========================================================================
   2026-09-28 AAA polish pass. One block, last in the file, so it wins without
   hunting the older layers above. Existing elements only: nothing here adds a
   component; it retunes the ones the pages already render.
   One motion system: 120ms press, 200ms hover/colour, 320ms panels, all on
   cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1). Every var() below carries a fallback.
   ========================================================================== */

/* 1. Money: tabular figures everywhere a price or balance shows, one face
      (Roboto, not Roboto Mono), and cents drawn smaller via <Money>. */
html body .grid-price, html body .grid-steam-price, html body .modal-stat-val,
