/* Look pass 2026-10-08: market grid
   1. Card footers line up across a row. The body already stretches to the
      row height, but the seller/age line sat wherever the price block ended,
      so auction cards, "2 listings" cards and plain cards each put it at a
      different height. Pin it to the bottom of the card.
   2. Phone toolbar reads as tidy rows instead of a ragged wrap: sort fills
      its row, All/Buy Now/Auction is a full-width segmented control, and
      the three chips share the last row evenly. Same controls, same order
